DESCRIPTION:Brisbane's best improv comedy! Featuring some of Brisbane’s f
 unniest comedians\, Big Fork’s Big Fun Showcase is exactly what make’s
  Big Fork Theatre Brisbane’s home of improv comedy! Expect a night of la
 ughs\, excitement and thrills as you sit on the edge of your seat wonderin
 g ‘was that really unscripted?’ Trust us – you couldn’t write this
  if you tried. In its 11th year of making audiences laugh and teaching the
  next generation of comedians\, Big Fork Theatre is a Brisbane Institution
 . This Showcase shows off our purpose built theatre and what makes us one 
 of Brisbane’s best nights out! Featuring funny scenes\, musical improv\,
  special guests and more\, it’s an event not be missed. If you are a fan
  of Dropout TV\, Who’s Line is it Anyway? or Thank God You’re Here\, t
 his is your gateway show to more hilarious nights at Big Fork Theatre\, wh
 ere every show is hilarious and completely unique. Featuring Brisbane's be
 st improv comedians. TICKETS ARE ONLY $20 ONLINE | $25 ON THE DOOR
